{"pageid": 811, "title": "Parker Parents", "revid": 1910, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Archer's Peak", "Unnamed characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Parker Parents</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d2/Parker_Parents.png/revision/latest?cb=20241223115516\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Parker Parents\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d2/Parker_Parents.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20241223115516\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d2/Parker_Parents.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20241223115516 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d2/Parker_Parents.png/revision/latest?cb=20241223115516 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Parker Parents\" width=\"216\" height=\"500\" data-image-key=\"Parker_Parents.png\" data-image-name=\"Parker Parents.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Alive</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corey_Parker\" title=\"Corey Parker\">Corey Parker</a> † <small>(son)</small><br /><p><a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Parker\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">Brendan Parker</a> † <small>(son)</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Parker\" title=\"Jason Parker\">Jason Parker</a> † <small>(son)</small><br />Unnamed fourth child †<br /></p></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #7</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #9</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The unnamed <b>mother</b> and <b>father</b> of the <b>Parker family</b> lived in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> during the 2020 <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>. One of their children would be killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Oscuratype Mother</span>, and while at the school gymnasium to identify the body, their other three children would be murdered by <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">its litter</span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>The Parkers were a couple who had four children: <a href=\"/wiki/Corey_Parker\" title=\"Corey Parker\">Corey</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Parker\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">Brendan</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Parker\" title=\"Jason Parker\">Jason</a>, along with a fourth unnamed child.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC8&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC8-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Their fourth child would be attacked and killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Oscuratype Mother</span> in 2020, with their body later being found in its den by the lake.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC4&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC4-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> \n</p><p>The parents were called to come to the school gymnasium, the only place big enough to hold all the body parts, and identify their child's remains. At Jason's request, the other boys came along, though Jason would later run into the woods, followed by his brothers. The Parker parents attempted to \"barge in\" to the gym to see their child, but <a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Tim Cavanaugh\">Tim Cavanaugh</a> stopped them, telling them to keep things orderly. They would still be arguing with him and sobbing when <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> arrived.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC7&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC7-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a> would find Tommy among the remains of their other boys, and expressed horror at the thought of having to tell them that they'd lost three more of their children. They were still most likely present at the gymnasium when the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Oscuratype Children</span> would attack and kill another girl in the parking lot.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC10&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC10-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Their children's deaths would be blamed on Tommy Mahoney.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearances\">Physical appearances</span></h2>\n<p>The Parkers are only briefly seen; Ms. Parker has short brown hair, matching <a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Parker\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">her son, Brendan</a>, while Mr. Parker has dirty blonde hair and a beard. Both appear to be of European descent.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 8\">Issue #8</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"85e47f3f8789132e726a914c0bccaeb7\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Parker_Parents-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:79px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Parker_Parents.png\" title=\"Parker Parents.png (286 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:79px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d2/Parker_Parents.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/79?cb=20241223115516\" title=\"Parker Parents.png (286 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #7\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Parker Parents.png\" data-image-key=\"Parker_Parents.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Parker Parents.png (286 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Issue #7\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Parker Parents.png\" data-image-key=\"Parker_Parents.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/d/d2/Parker_Parents.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/79?cb=20241223115516\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_7\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 7\">Issue #7</a></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC8-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC8_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The House of Slaughter (comic arc)\">vol. #2</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_8\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Ch